<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 101.60 to 6,544.09. For the week, the Dow industrials fell 16.82 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.53 to 394.06.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 47 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1,850 to 717.</p>
<p>Volume was 451,947,940, compared with 461,025,990, Thursday. For the week, volume totalled 1,653,997,940 shares.</p>
